{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2055701841732837672","created_at":"2026-05-16T17:28:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2055701841732837672"],"id":"2055701841732837672","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":15696,"like_count":192,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":51,"retweet_count":14},"text":"如果看生殖器官会让你开心的话 那我就给你看 这没什么 我觉得真正隐私的是我的想法","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2055701841732837672"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2055694550912639487","created_at":"2026-05-16T16:59:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2055694550912639487"],"id":"2055694550912639487","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":3998,"like_count":79,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":6},"text":"思考带来的痛苦抹杀了人的生命，人类还觉得这上是天赐予的礼物。原来得到礼物的代价就是承担痛苦吗？遵守着等价交换的法则为什么世界上还有那么多不公平的事，完全没有任何话语能解释因为就是这样的埋怨也没有用","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2055694550912639487"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2055601234690891926","created_at":"2026-05-16T10:48:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2055601234690891926"],"id":"2055601234690891926","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2870,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":3},"text":"也许你变了，也许我变了，也许世界变了。我能做的是保持必要的迟钝，让自己，平衡这种陌生。才能让心脏起伏地平缓。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2055601234690891926"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2055581174056325587","created_at":"2026-05-16T09:28:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2055581174056325587"],"id":"2055581174056325587","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4235,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"半个月没打的后果 https://t.co/Qqrtacl2z1","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2055581174056325587"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2055536001960038779","created_at":"2026-05-16T06:29:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2055536001960038779"],"i